{"chunk_id": "8f181741a33e", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "柴油发电机组介绍", "date_hint": "", "text": "柴油发电机组是以柴油发动机为核心动力源，驱动同步发电机发电的机电一体化设备16。其通过燃烧柴油产生机械能，再通过电磁感应原理转化为电能，适用于日常供电、应急备用等多种场景。\n数据中心基础设施建设成本中，柴油发电机组成本占比第一，23%。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "8f181741a33e", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
